     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Merck, inpt ⍉in ICU, ⍉MRSA/Pseudomonas RF:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " azithro plus a beta-lactam (eg, cefotaxime, ceftriaxone, ceftaroline), or an antipneumococcal fluoroquinolone alone"
     }
